      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\n\nDAY 15, TUESDAY 14TH OCTOBER, 2025\n\nCOMMISSIONING OF ACCESS ROADS IN SECTOR CENTRE BY DAKIBIYU DISTRICT\n\nThe FCT motoring public are hereby informed of the commissioning of the above project by the Hon. Minister of the FCT, his Excellency Chief (Barr) Ezenwo Nyesom Wike CON.\n\nAs such traffic towards the Dakibiyu road (Asuquo Okon Way) will be slightly affected during movement of dignitaries.\n\nThe Jerry Eze street by Code of Conduct Tribunal, Dakibiyu is venue of the event.\n\nAccess to locations like Yaliam Press Ltd., Police Service Commission and others will be under controlled access by traffic and security personnel.\n\nDeployment commences at 800hrs.\n\n- Head Traffic, DRTS",
